          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "We work on heating, cooling, and ventilation, including a maintenance check and a repair, for homes and for businesses. When you are choosing a system, we will walk through the options. On a cooling call the fork is simple: put the current unit back to work, or talk through a different system."
            }
