          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The system runs and the rooms never catch up."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The outdoor unit is not starting, or it is doing something it did not do last season."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "You want maintenance on equipment that still cools, rather than a repair of a breakdown."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The problem is heat, not cooling. That visit belongs on the heating repair page."
