      "title": "Why we built this site",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why we built this site"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "This page is for the owner of Quality Heating & Air and for human copy QA. It is not a page for a homeowner to hire from."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The approval this draft follows"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Josh approved the page jobs in chat on 2026-09-30: homepage intent HVAC contractor Lebanon MO, AC repair Lebanon MO, and heating repair Lebanon MO. He said to move it to stage two and have Cursor write the words. He also allowed top-ten Maps ranks and listing counts under 21. That approval does not accept this copy, a build, or the Scout repair work on ff-2-demos pull request 270."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "There was no Cursor prescription in this repository to reuse. Routes are the conventional Content Factory set: / for this overview, /home, /ac-repair-lebanon-mo, /heating-repair-lebanon-mo, and /contact. No earlier approved route map existed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What the customer can do"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The homepage introduces the Highway 32 shop and sends people to cooling or heating. The AC page stays on cooling repair versus a system consultation. The heating page refuses a furnace-only claim because the official site does not make one. Contact repeats the published phone, email, Jobber request, hours, and the separate WhatsApp number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What we left out on purpose"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No customer quotations. The discovery listing said 192 reviews. The normalized export dropped the review text, and this worker could not re-read Apify dataset o3rGh1edmkftb6dNG without APIFY_API_TOKEN. No new paid Apify call was made. Prior discovery spend on that run was 0.2832 USD of a 5 USD cap."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No Premier Dealer, factory-trained, or Amana-dealer badge. Lennox does list the shop at the matching address and phone. The Premier language on that page reads as generic explanation."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No 24/7 or same-day promise. The site says emergency service is available and publishes weekday hours plus weekend by appointment."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No defined guarantee. The homepage heading says Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed and does not define the remedy."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No financing terms. Only the application link they publish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No extra service routes for maintenance, ventilation, or replacement."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Still for a person"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Confirm whether weekend by appointment is the line you want next to the emergency heading. Confirm that (417) 288-2968 should appear as WhatsApp only. Confirm any town list beyond Lebanon before a builder adds one."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "route": "/"
